[I] Core part of Cairo-Dock project

[T] Cairo-Dock is a pretty, light and convenient desktop interface that can
[T] replace a system panel, featuring multiple docks, a taskbar, launchers
[T] and applets. This is the core part of the project, while views, applets
[T] and effects are provided by cairo-dock-plug-ins.

[U] https://github.com/Cairo-Dock/cairo-dock-core

[A] Cairo-Dock
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS
[R] - alpha arc avr32 blackfin cris hppa hppa64 i860 m68k microblaze nios2 openrisc superh

[E] opt systemd

[L] GPL3
